== U⁻: Church numerals with the zero test strict in the whole numeral
  (λx:ℕ. 0) Ω                          : ℕ        0                               the PCF result
  ifz (succ Ω) then 0 else 1           : ℕ        no normal form within the fuel  no result within the limit (PCF diverges)
  ifz 0 then 7 else Ω                  : ℕ        7                               the PCF result
  ifz 1 then Ω else 7                  : ℕ        7                               the PCF result
  pred 0                               : ℕ        0                               the PCF result
  pred Ω                               : ℕ        no normal form within the fuel  no result within the limit (PCF diverges)
  ifz (pred (succ Ω)) then 0 else 1    : ℕ        no normal form within the fuel  no result within the limit (PCF diverges)
  succ Ω                               : ℕ        no normal form within the fuel  no result within the limit (PCF diverges)
  (ifz 0 then succ else pred) 5        : ℕ        6                               the PCF result
  (ifz 1 then succ else pred) 5        : ℕ        4                               the PCF result
  (ifz (succ Ω) then succ else pred) 5 : ℕ        no normal form within the fuel  no result within the limit (PCF diverges)
  (ifz 0 then succ else Ω_ℕ→ℕ) 5       : ℕ        6                               the PCF result
  No result within the limit is not a proof of divergence.

== U⁻: the usual lazy test answers where PCF diverges
  ifz_lazy (succ Ω) then 0 else 1 = 1, which contradicts PCF

== PCF → U⁻: programs, PCF evaluator, and the translation by normal order
  Each translation is checked against ℕ by the U⁻ checker before it runs.
  (λx:ℕ. 0) Ω                          PCF 0                          U⁻ : ℕ 0                               agrees
  ifz (succ Ω) then 0 else 1           PCF no value within the fuel   U⁻ : ℕ no normal form within the fuel  no result within the limit
  ifz 0 then 7 else Ω                  PCF 7                          U⁻ : ℕ 7                               agrees
  ifz 1 then Ω else 7                  PCF 7                          U⁻ : ℕ 7                               agrees
  pred 0                               PCF 0                          U⁻ : ℕ 0                               agrees
  pred Ω                               PCF no value within the fuel   U⁻ : ℕ no normal form within the fuel  no result within the limit
  ifz (pred (succ Ω)) then 0 else 1    PCF no value within the fuel   U⁻ : ℕ no normal form within the fuel  no result within the limit
  succ Ω                               PCF no value within the fuel   U⁻ : ℕ no normal form within the fuel  no result within the limit
  (ifz 0 then succ else pred) 5        PCF 6                          U⁻ : ℕ 6                               agrees
  (ifz 1 then succ else pred) 5        PCF 4                          U⁻ : ℕ 4                               agrees
  (ifz 0 then succ else Ω_ℕ→ℕ) 5       PCF 6                          U⁻ : ℕ 6                               agrees
  add 2 3                              PCF 5                          U⁻ : ℕ 5                               agrees
  mul 2 3                              PCF 6                          U⁻ : ℕ 6                               agrees
  fact 0                               PCF 1                          U⁻ : ℕ 1                               agrees
  fact 1                               PCF 1                          U⁻ : ℕ 1                               agrees
  fact 2                               PCF 2                          U⁻ : ℕ 2                               agrees
  fact 3                               PCF 6                          U⁻ : ℕ 6                               agrees
  (λ_. _) 0                            PCF 0                          U⁻ : ℕ 0                               agrees
  fact 4 = 24 takes about 1.4 million steps: make -C extraction slow

